  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Belleville, New Jersey · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>Nicole &amp; Phil<br><em>Nanina’s in the Park</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Nicole and Phil’s wedding film, alongside five photographs from the preparations.</p><nav class=\"gv-story-nav\" aria-label=\"Explore this wedding\"><a href=\"#wedding-film\">The film</a><a href=\"#wedding-photographs\">The photographs</a></nav></header><section id=\"wedding-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Nicole &amp; Phil wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h2>The wedding film</h2></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1280/544\"><img src=\"/assets/nicole-philip-poster.jpg\" width=\"1280\" height=\"544\" alt=\"Nicole &amp; Phil, from the existing GioLina portfolio\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"425185852\" data-film-title=\"Nicole &amp; Phil\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Nicole &amp; Phil\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Nicole &amp; Phil · A film by GioLina Films</p></section><section id=\"wedding-photographs\" class=\"gv-editorial\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-story-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Selected photographs</p><h2 id=\"gv-story-title\">Before the celebration.</h2><p>Bridal portraits, finishing touches and a family moment before the ceremony.</p></section><section class=\"gv-gallery\" aria-label=\"Selected photographs of Nicole &amp; Phil\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/nicole-phil-bridal-portrait.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Nicole holding her bouquet in a doorway\"><img src=\"/assets/nicole-phil-bridal-portrait-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/nicole-phil-bridal-portrait-small.webp 320w, /assets/nicole-phil-bridal-portrait.webp 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"640\" height=\"960\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Nicole holding her bouquet in a doorway\"></a><figcaption>Nicole, before the ceremony.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/nicole-phil-beside-her-dress.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Nicole beside her wedding dress in soft window light\"><img src=\"/assets/nicole-phil-beside-her-dress-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/nicole-phil-beside-her-dress-small.webp 640w, /assets/nicole-phil-beside-her-dress.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Nicole beside her wedding dress in soft window light\"></a><figcaption>The dress and the preparations.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/nicole-phil-earring-detail.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Nicole adjusting her earring before the ceremony\"><img src=\"/assets/nicole-phil-earring-detail-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/nicole-phil-earring-detail-small.webp 640w, /assets/nicole-phil-earring-detail.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Nicole adjusting her earring before the ceremony\"></a><figcaption>A finishing detail.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/nicole-phil-family-moment.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Nicole sharing a family moment before the ceremony\"><img src=\"/assets/nicole-phil-family-moment-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/nicole-phil-family-moment-small.webp 640w, /assets/nicole-phil-family-moment.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Nicole sharing a family moment before the ceremony\"></a><figcaption>Together before the ceremony.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/nicole-phil-window-silhouette.webp\" data-photo-viewer-link aria-label=\"View Nicole in silhouette with her bouquet and wedding dress\"><img src=\"/assets/nicole-phil-window-silhouette-small.webp\" srcset=\"/assets/nicole-phil-window-silhouette-small.webp 640w, /assets/nicole-phil-window-silhouette.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width:650px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width:1100px) calc(100vw - 48px), 1072px\" width=\"1280\" height=\"853\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Nicole in silhouette with her bouquet and wedding dress\"></a><figcaption>A quiet portrait by the window.</figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Essex County</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">Nanina’s in the Park</h2></div><div><p>Nanina’s in the Park is in Belleville, New Jersey. This wedding story brings together GioLina’s film and a selection of Nicole’s preparation portraits.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://naninasinthepark.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><div class=\"gv-collection-link\"><a href=\"/photography/wedding-collection/\">View the wedding photography collection</a></div><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your wedding at Nanina’s in the Park</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more wedding stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/the-rockleigh/\">Bianca &amp; Bobby at The Rockleigh</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/photography-viewer.js\" defer></script>"
